OL,3,GNEWSADIY SOS-style house rebuild set
OL,4,Afor blaze victims
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We're going to have to get out of
OL,7,Fhere, pronto," was what John Draycott
OL,8,Fsaid to wife Veronica as a fire raced
OL,9,Ftowards their home.
OL,11,FThe couple escaped with seconds to
OL,12,Fspare as flames spread through their
OL,13,FSandyford house, which was gutted and
OL,14,Flater demolished after a barbecue blaze
OL,15,Fgot out of control.
OL,17,FNow, a community-led campaign is aiming
OL,18,Fto rebuild the house, the worst
OL,19,Faffected in the fire that tore through
OL,20,Fthe area of Stoke-on-Trent on 13 August
OL,21,Famid tinder dry conditions, from the
OL,22,Fground up.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
