OL,3,GNEWSADIY SOS-style house rebuild set
OL,4,Afor blaze victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurtis Peters, of TS Domestics, and
OL,7,FJavaid Iqbal, from Impact Stoke, hope
OL,8,Ftradespeople, firms and residents will
OL,9,Fdonate skills, labour and materials for
OL,10,Fthe project, which needs planning
OL,11,Fpermission.
